# Context for web.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this instead of the root
# .dockerignore, which is shaped for the API image): the two Vite apps and the
# Caddyfile, nothing else.
*
!apps/branding/auth-ui/
!apps/central/admin/
!deploy/onprem/Caddyfile
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
